ican John Deaton, a former Marine and attorney running as an anti-Trump Republican, has struggled to gain traction. He trails badly in fundraising, and outside groups have shown little interest in engaging on his behalf. Independent Shiva Ayyadurai and unenrolled candidate Joe Tache remain marginal. Betting markets give Markey roughly a 98 percent chance of winning, and all major race raters place this in the Safe or Solid Democratic column. The main drama is the final margin, not the outcome.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.9975, "margin": 19.63}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.998, "margin": 20.0}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "p_dem": 0.9963, "margin": 20.0}, {"date": "2026-09-25", "p_dem": 0.9982, "margin": 20.5}, {"date": "2026-09-26", "p_dem": 0.9978, "margin": 21.0}, {"date": "2026-09-27", "p_dem": 0.9987, "margin": 21.0}, {"date": "2026-09-28", "p_dem": 0.9983, "margin": 21.0}, {"date": "2026-09-29", "p_dem": 0.998, "margin": 21.0}, {"date": "2026-09-30", "p_dem": 0.9983, "margin": 22.0}, {"date": "2026-10-01", "p_dem": 0.9988, "margin": 22.0}, {"date": "2026-10-02", "p_dem": 0.999, "margin": 24.0}, {"date": "2026-10-03", "p_dem": 0.9994, "margin": 24.0}, {"date": "2026-10-04", "p_dem": 0.9989, "margin": 24.0}]}